{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人李佳芯（Ali）今日（24日）以健康大使身份出席活動，向市民推廣預防中風訊息，台上分享了身邊年輕友人的中風經歷，及分享自己的「防風錦囊」。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Ali表示向來注重個人健康問題，提到她早年曾接受卵巢囊</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T08:03:01.145004+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T07:08:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T07:58:11.655878+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:58:11.655878+00:00","content_hash":"881f86d99c798d3d2c085c36bd744c5c10d72f59efb50cdb37e6f1f7b6fb0624","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}